|} .

# =========================================================================== #
# TEMPORAL RELATIONS — Allen's interval algebra (event/temporal design temporal deepening).
# Each gmeow event-event Allen relation aligns to OWL-Time's interval* relation
# (relatedMatch — OWL-Time relates the INTERVALS, GMEOW the events that bear
# them) and to the Time Event Ontology (TEO, closeMatch — TEO relates events
# too, and is BFO-grounded like GMEOW). ISO-TimeML is an XML annotation standard
# with no canonical RDF namespace, so its TLINK relType VALUES are documented as
# a correspondence in each relation's skos:definition and below, not as IRI cells.
# TEO terms use the published ontology IRI https://sbmi.uth.edu/bsdi/TEO_1.0.0.owl
# (Li et al., JAMIA 2020); by-reference closeMatch, never imported.
# =========================================================================== #

